cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software or the results it contains, please cite both the
  software archive and the paper it accompanies.
title: >-
  target-mixup-core: code, derived results and pre-specification records for a
  staged study of target mix-ups in AI-assisted lung CT analysis
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, derived results, freeze records and protocol documents for a
  three-stage study of where target mix-ups arise in AI-assisted imaging
  analysis: a stratified audit of public lung CT DICOM segmentations, a controlled gate
  experiment, and expert requests in three hash-frozen sets with a lobe
  adjudication. No images are included.
type: software
license: MIT
